Use case: illustration-story, game animation sprite sheet. Match the attached Mirror Keeper awakening mirror's exact ornate gilded frame, creamy carved scrollwork, teal diamond finial, wine-red velvet details, turquoise glass and warm layered hand-painted storybook rendering.
THREE equal square cells in ONE horizontal strip, intended finished size 768x256. A complete single small standing mirror pane in each cell, upright front three-quarter view, identical frame design, scale, placement, tassels and feet. The metal frame and feet remain pixel-aligned in concept across all frames. Change ONLY the GLASS:
1 still turquoise reflective glass with a soft upper-left silver reflection;
2 glass elastically dents inward around a small off-center incoming impact, with a shallow concave ripple, no cracked or broken frame;
3 the same intact glass releases a bright SILVER-cream reflected streak angled to the right, a short narrow streak kept inside this cell, while frame stays fixed.
No extra mirrors, person, weapon, projectile object, environment reflection scene, text, numbers, labels, grid, ground, cast shadow or glow ring. Genuine RGBA transparent background and at least 14% empty transparent margin on EVERY side of EACH cell, including the return streak. Brass/cream/teal light only, never glowing red. Clear simple silhouette for a 256px frame used much smaller in game.
